+### AI boundary
+
+The real DeepSeek provider is wired into:
+
+- assistant planner (`POST /api/assistant/plan`);
+- candidate repair provider (`binaryrepair_ai.provider`).
+
+A model response is still only a plan or candidate. It is schema-checked, staged
+as input, and then V0–V5 must pass. The model cannot set `verdict`, cannot write
+evidence, and cannot turn `not_run` into a pass.
+
+**This is deliberate. See
+[`docs/architecture/ai-adjudication-boundary.md`](../architecture/ai-adjudication-boundary.md).**
 
